        answer: "Wallach teaches that age spots (liver spots) are rancid fat \u2014 ceroid lipofuscin or trans fatty acids \u2014 from cell walls accumulating under the skin; ten on the back of the hand mean millions in the organs, and they flag a high risk of cancer and heart disease. Because they are reversible, his treatment is to eliminate all fried foods and vegetable oils (salad dressing, cooking oils, margarine) plus sugar, with selenium and vitamin E.",
