        verbatim: "It\noccurs abundantly in diets containing whole grains and\nraw vegetables as inositol phospholipids and as phytic acid\n(inositol hexaphosphate or \u201Cphytates\u201D).\n\n\n \n\nPhytic acid interferes with the absorption of calcium,\niron, zinc and other nutrients - on one hand a required nutrient\nand on the other a negative in the diet.",
