        verbatim: "Vegans as a group tend to lie to themselves and\nconvince themselves (and try to convince others) that all of\nthe long-lived people on earth do not eat animal products. In\nfact all long lived peoples on earth eat red meat (including\npork, beef, goat, lamb, etc.), poultry, fish, eggs and dairy.",
